    {name="Drowned Ruins",intro="Cerelle follows a flickering light beneath the coast. Wisps guard the flooded halls, but a hungry Shade waits below.",ending="The coastal beacon shines again. Its light reveals a forgotten passage into Ashenvale's sleeping grove.",rooms=6},
